- v1.3x: First generation of STorM32 boards. A large number of variations exist which are the variants of the original v1.3 board, not supported by the v3.xx firmware.
- v4.1: It is based on the STM32F103RC microcontroller. It is similar to the v3.3 series of boards, except, it has motor drivers on the board itself. It is not supported by the v3.xx firmware.

